cakramadhye tu saṃcintya tataḥ pūjāṃ samārabhet |

	mahātripuramudrāṃ trikhaṇḍākhyāṃ mudrāṃ baddhveti śeṣaḥ | 
pūrvoktāvāhanavidyayā'nte namaskārādernama ihā'gacchā'gaccheti 
