saṃkṣobhiṇyādiyonyantamudrānavakaṃ 
mūlādhārādibrahmarandhrāntasthānanavake smṛtvā'vāhanavidyāyā 
ante subhage nama iti pañcākṣarīṃ saṃyojya devīmāvāhya 
pūjayedityartha ityāhuḥ | navyāstu (-)

